  "title": "月之符文 66 符文文學 Registry",
  "scope": "66 runes only; canonical definitions are not stored or overridden here.",
  "governance": {
    "purpose": "記錄每一符相關的文學與創作文本，供搜尋、歷史比較與語意演變分析使用。",
